      'Opening flow: start in deal; dealer may use deal before bid.',
      'Scoring check: Score by bid value (e.g. Nickel Solo: bid value times 5 cents per opponent). Declarer pays each opponent if set; opponents pay declarer if contract is made. Mackers and First/Last add bonuses. Expected outcome: Declarer (and partner if applicable) must win the contracted number of tricks (e.g. 5 for Question/IsIt/Solo, 6 for 6 Trick Solo, 8 for Bull Solo). If successful, declarer scores; otherwise defenders score..',
